Package: POSsimulation
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Probability of Success (PoS) Simulation for Oncology Trials
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jinjie", "Chen", email = "jinjie.chen@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: An interactive Shiny application for simulating and calculating 
    Bayesian Probability of Success (PoS) for oncology clinical trials. The app
    uses hierarchical Bayesian models with Stan to incorporate historical trial
    data and current trial information for OS (Overall Survival) and PFS 
    (Progression-Free Survival) endpoints. Features include customizable priors,
    data generation, and real-time MCMC diagnostics.
